    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/5ecf0d80f09d2f7c8021b9ebaacfd6d4.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the animal workplace, weekends have become a luxury, and overtime is the norm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/001276638c82fdb4a23819fb7aa3339a.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While taking a nap, a rabbit learned from an angel that if it continued working overtime, it would die from overwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the task it currently holds cannot be completed without overtime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with this, it chose... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/26cf714d45cddf86e10f2bde616676b9.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No more endurance! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It raised its weapon high and began to fight back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The targets of the retaliation ranged from the team leader to the CEO. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of this before Officer Fox arrives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/5cd5e3a905115445e28fe98c46e1914d.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go forward, keep moving forward...</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game content:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a rabbit struggling in the animal workplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first-person perspective, vent your frustration and stress about working overtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fists to defeat all the bad guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/5ecf0d80f09d2f7c8021b9ebaacfd6d4.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the animal workplace, weekends have become a luxury, and overtime is the norm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/001276638c82fdb4a23819fb7aa3339a.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While taking a nap, a rabbit learned from an angel that if it continued working overtime, it would die from overwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the task it currently holds cannot be completed without overtime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with this, it chose... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/26cf714d45cddf86e10f2bde616676b9.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No more endurance! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It raised its weapon high and began to fight back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The targets of the retaliation ranged from the team leader to the CEO. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of this before Officer Fox arrives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835930/extras/5cd5e3a905115445e28fe98c46e1914d.avif?t=1751542896\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go forward, keep moving forward...</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game content:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a rabbit struggling in the animal workplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first-person perspective, vent your frustration and stress about working overtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fists to defeat all the bad guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
